    "### Entrenamiento\n",
    "Utilizaremos el algoritmo <code>KNeighborsClassifier</code> de <b>scikit-learn</b> (<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.KNeighborsClassifier.html?highlight=kneighborsclassifier#sklearn.neighbors.KNeighborsClassifier\">documentación del algoritmo</a>)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 49,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Tiempo entrenamiento = 1.714 ms\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "k = Score.argmax()    # Número de vecinos\n",
    "\n",
    "# Creamos nuestra instancia de nuestro algoritmo KNN con 4 vecinos\n",
    "neigh = KNeighborsClassifier(n_neighbors = k, weights='distance')\n",
